  "body": "This PR fixes https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/4325, which highlights a bug where a `<link rel=stylesheet>` fails to decrement a Document's script-blocking style sheet counter when, by the time the response is processed by the network, the element no longer contributes to the styling processing model.\n\nThe way we achieve this is by: instead of immediately returning once we recognize that `<var>el</var>` no longer contributes to style, we first check to see if at the time `<var>resource</var>` was fetched `<var>el</var>` was script-blocking (and therefore would have incremented the script-blocking style sheet counter.\n\nThis is kind of a weird way to do this, since we're checking the value of _contributes a script-blocking style sheet_ as it was _in the past_, which is kind of funny since we haven't cached that value anywhere, but I don't know a better way to do this besides performing a bunch of book-keeping which I suppose I could introduce, but would like to avoid if possible :)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8552/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 26, 2023, 10:37 PM UTC (e92b387)\">/interaction.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8552/30ba56f...e92b387/interaction.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 26, 2023, 10:37 PM UTC (e92b387)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8552/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 26, 2023, 10:37 PM UTC (e92b387)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8552/30ba56f...e92b387/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 26, 2023, 10:37 PM UTC (e92b387)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8552/semantics.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 26, 2023, 10:37 PM UTC (e92b387)\">/semantics.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/8552/30ba56f...e92b387/semantics.html\" title=\"Last updated on Jan 26, 2023, 10:37 PM UTC (e92b387)\">diff</a> )",
